# PC Connect: How to use, What you need, Browse scripts, Export (+ light theme)
wait 200
open pcconnect_howto
wait 200
shot pcconnect_howto
key down
wait 60
shot pcconnect_howto_scrolled
theme light
wait 120
shot pcconnect_howto_light
theme dark
wait 80
key esc
wait 80
open pcconnect_needs
wait 200
shot pcconnect_needs
key down
key down
key down
wait 60
shot pcconnect_needs_scrolled
key esc
wait 80
open pcconnect_scripts
wait 200
shot pcconnect_scripts
key esc
wait 80
open pcconnect_export
wait 400
shot pcconnect_export
key esc
wait 80
quit
